;    8: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はいかい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=34, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しんぴょうせい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=356, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=ばら, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   19: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=すもも, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   20: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=な, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=8037, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=7403, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The place where I ran into <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> just now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was dead silent, as if the commotion with the residents had never happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, there was no one here.<PG>
I carefully searched the ground all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were lots of fresh footprints, but nothing that looked like bloodstains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether there was no fight at all, or it was settled so quickly that no blood was even shed, I can't be sure.<PG>
But if they'd made peace, they ought to have done something like calling us back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That they haven't means―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> has gone missing yet again―or else she really was a corpse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, as things stand, it's hard to guess <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> current situation.<PG>
But if she isn't a corpse, it's fair to assume that <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> isn't hiding of her own will, but has been carried off yet again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I try going back to the settlement for now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's far too dangerous, but I'd like to know at least how things are in the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I see how things are in the settlement, I should be able to tell what happened here earlier.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Never had I been so glad to be small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Getting back to the settlement while staying hidden took little effort.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lights were on in the houses, and there were signs of people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means that, right now, the residents are each acting on their own.<PG>
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I heard footsteps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I quickly hid behind a nearby hedge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently two or so people were walking this way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hear them talking. Grown men's voices.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "10000" "PASS"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan's</STYLE> dead after all, I bet."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So the curse-killing happened this year too, in the end..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Look at it the other way―it means we get to live another year."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But isn't something off this year? There was that weird sound."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Wasn't that a helicopter passing nearby?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Does a helicopter make a sound like that?"<PG>
"Well, <STYLE ID="2">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> have it rough. Trying to solve something like a curse."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And this year it's <STYLE ID="1">the Niimura girl</STYLE>, of all people. 
{PAUSE ""}
Maybe this settlement should just break up already..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, I want to fight to the end. Run from here and I couldn't face our ancestors."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's easy to say, but..."<PG>
"I'm not telling you to do the same. These days, what you do is up to each of us."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I don't want to let this place go either, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, let's turn in early tonight. The thirteenth-year memorial's tomorrow, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who knows. <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan's</STYLE> still missing, so won't the search come first?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Either way, it's an early morning tomorrow."<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
―That was all I heard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them walked off without any sign of noticing me.<PG>
What was that conversation just now? Something's clearly wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They talked about <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> as if they knew nothing at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were those two the only ones who didn't join that group just now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But with that many people gathered, for the two who happened to pass by to be the only ones not in it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I went up to another house and listened to the sounds inside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\集落ある家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ow, ow, ow... I knew it, sore muscles..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Honestly, at your age, you overdo it... here, a compress."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, I'm worried about <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>. Disappearing at this time of year..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">That girl</STYLE> will be fine, I'm sure. Unlike you, she's a born athlete."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... she'll be fine, won't she."<PG>
The next house―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"That fire at the Niimura place―what was that about, in the end..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Seems there were important books in there, and somebody tried to burn them."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> missing, a suspicious fire... it's one thing after another this year."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is absolutely wrong! Nobody knows <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> showed up!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the people I eavesdropped on just happened not to be in that group, it might hold up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―even if they weren't in the group, they would know about <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
Then who was that group just now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They know about <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, and they think going to the abandoned hut is a bad idea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hypothesis that fits these conditions is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE追加\肩をたたく.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And just then, someone <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たた">tapped</STYLE> me on the shoulder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who on earth had found me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone connected to the Niimura house would be safe, but if not―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Um, <STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE>... you're one of the girls from Motoki-cho, aren't you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A well-built middle-aged man was standing there.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uh, uh, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Oh, sorry, did I scare you? I'm Shirozaki. 
{PAUSE ""}
Sorry you had to come at such an awful time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I'm... Erina Goto..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What are you doing out here? Want me to walk you to the Niimura house?
{PAUSE ""}
　Nobody knows where <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> went, either. You shouldn't be wandering around alone, okay?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Shirozaki-san turned toward the Niimura house without waiting for my answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I don't know whether I can trust this man.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―even supposing I can't, resisting might be more dangerous still.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed Shirozaki-san in silence, keeping a little distance.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Just in case, keep your eyes open as we walk. Even I'd be scared to walk around alone, the way things are."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's wrong... this is all wrong!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who were those people just now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not residents of the Arata settlement―that much is certain.<PG>
Yet even <STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE> assumed they were residents of the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, a large group of people even the residents of the settlement don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A large group that never showed itself until now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A group that fits that description... there's only one, after all.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
I had it backwards.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been thinking in terms of whether <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was living or dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way of thinking was completely backwards.<PG>
That group just now―
{PAUSE ""}
they are the ones who are... 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
corpses.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神軍団武器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The most reasonable reading is that people who should be dead, like <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>, are <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="はいかい">walking about</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd thought <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> might be a corpse, but that was completely wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was resisting the group of corpses―<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―alone.<PG>
Either way, the odds that <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and the others are safe have gone up a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, going to the abandoned hut as <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> instructed is probably best.<PG>
Then what did the corpses do to <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did they carry her off again?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, why are the corpses―<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>―so fixated on <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> precognition is the problem, it would be no surprise if <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> were carried off at any moment too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is being given information little by little too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I were <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, I'd want to capture <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> in advance as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, at least, didn't become a target just now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The difference between <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>... what is it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is second generation, and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is third generation―
{PAUSE ""}
no, but then <STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE> is third generation too, so she could just as well be a target for capture...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> learned too much about <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would be a convincing enough reason in its own way, but...<PG>
Then why was <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> caught twice?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's plausible is this: <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was caught once, but negotiated something with <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> and joined hands with it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that was so that <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> senses would not be read, and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> real aim lay elsewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, she is only pretending to have joined hands with <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
Then, if the commotion just now was an act put on by <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and the corpses, what was the corpses' aim?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was the aim to make us go to the abandoned hut?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But then they should have said "go to the hut," not "go back to the settlement."<PG>
To give <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> advice <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="しんぴょうせい">credibility</STYLE>, did the corpses deliberately say the opposite?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If at that moment the people in Noh masks had said "go to the hut" and <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had likewise said "go to the hut," we would have distrusted <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
Beyond this point, there's nothing left to base a guess on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point, it could be interpreted in any direction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I need some information to narrow it down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
