<BR>
But it was also a signal that <STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE> was ready to accept that story.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then do you know of a fungus called </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
