<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hmm... Sorry, never heard of it. Is that something </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was looking into?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> was reading the books in the storehouse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is a monster that nests in this land; it controls the dead at will, and in the end it turns humans into cherry trees and makes them part of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s own body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I think, was taken away by those corpses."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE> raised the eyes she'd lowered to me and straightened the head she'd tilted.<PG>
