<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you have any idea where those corpses are?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"On the forest path toward the graveyard clearing, I saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and the corpses. </STYLE>
