<STYLE ID="2">But I never thought it could be used to solve the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If it helps, I don't mind telling you now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Please."</STYLE><PG>
Something only the Grand Witches down the line had been told―
