I don't know whether it will help, but I want any clue I can get.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just a clue to finding <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, but a clue to resolving this whole situation.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The dead come forth from the underworld, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Those who have become corpses also become bewitching flowers and come forth from the underworld."</STYLE>
