<BR>
Bewitching flowers rise in rows, and the dead come forth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this the same as what's happening now...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Wait! That's...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. It's exactly what's happening now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then where is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...!"</STYLE><PG>
