<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The cave underground...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　You mean the one </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and the others went to search...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That cave, you see, was made. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">By the 'uncanny bewitching flowers.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> made the cave...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is a giant fungus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If its mycelial mat spreads across this whole area, it's no surprise that cavities would form where <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s giant hyphae once were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, the cave and the center of <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> are <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="つな">connected</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the corpses have kidnapped and confined <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, that cave, where <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can easily reach, would suit them.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"How far does that cave go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"To tell the truth, I've never been all the way to the back myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Cave-ins happen easily there, so going that far has been forbidden since before my time."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're not completely in the dark about </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm afraid I've never heard of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, or of corpses moving, outside the lore I just told you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If the books </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was reading say so, then </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> must know about it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was reading his way through those books, trying to cure </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> madness."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Have you never read the books in the storehouse, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's down there is in foreign tongues or old script, so it's too hard for me, frankly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm ashamed to say the only parts I've read are the customs for weddings and funerals, that sort of thing."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Is there any other lore? Anything that might connect to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There's more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">'The shinigami are the four divine messengers who serve Abaddon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Abaddon appears from a volcano of sulfur. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What the Grand Witch must do―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">is to keep Abaddon and the four divine messengers sealed away.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Abaddon...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Divine messengers...?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's oral tradition, so it isn't in the books, they say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Every Grand Witch in the line is made to learn it by heart, like the times tables."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The shinigami, Abaddon, the four divine messengers, sulfur―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Words I'm hearing for the first time... 
{PAUSE ""}
No―I've seen the same words somewhere!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere since coming to the Arata settlement...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\BGM_212.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "悪天候.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That scripture, 'The Teachings of Cerejeira'!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me recall the key passages―<PG>
<STYLE ID="17">The beautiful trees and flowers of the mother country.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">They resembled what in Japan is called the cherry, but they were also like the </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="ばら">rose</STYLE><STYLE ID="17"> and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="すもも">plum</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">We called them Bonita.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Bonita means 'beautiful' in our tongue.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">Then one day, with a great earthquake, Bonita changed beyond recognition into sinister forms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">The giant trees destroyed the towns and covered the whole sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">At the same time, every tree and flower other than Bonita withered away in an instant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Nor was that all. The dead came back to life and began to slaughter the people.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">At first we too led armies against the army of the dead, but we could never have matched an army that could not die.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Then, from a volcano of brimstone, there appeared four generals of the army of the dead, called divine messengers, and their demon king―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">Abaddon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">The divine messengers had cunning tongues and high intelligence, and far from merely killing us, one companion after another began to defect to the army of the dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Yes, our companions fell prey to suspicion feeding on itself, and in the end they began to kill one another.</STYLE><PG>
Yes―Abaddon, the four divine messengers, and sulfur: those words were all in there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So a fungus just like <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> existed somewhere other than here after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ginosuke Niimura, the founder of the Holy Cerejeira Church, had lived through the same kind of disaster in his mother country.<PG>
Abaddon, the four divine messengers, sulfur―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Among all the words that look like metaphors, the one I thought worth attention was the oddly specific substance 'brimstone'―sulfur.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the very existence of this lore is a second point to note.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lore is created to pass some event down to later generations.<PG>
Here, I became certain of one thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the past, the Arata settlement had lived through a disaster caused by <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not only Ginosuke Niimura's mother country, but this Arata too once came close to being wiped out by <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They must have recorded that disaster as lore, modeled on 'The Teachings of Cerejeira,' which had spread through the settlement in that era.<PG>
But the fact that this settlement has survived all along means the residents of that time must somehow have succeeded in driving <STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That method is―<BR>
'to keep Abaddon and the four divine messengers sealed away'<BR>
―that, and nothing else.<PG>
Furthermore, by considering it together with the research report, a more scientific, logical connection can be inferred.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it bothers me. 'Sulfur,' an oddly specific substance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A volcano of sulfur...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sulfur means...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Is there a volcano around here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　One that has erupted in the last 800 years."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I couldn't say... At least, I don't know of one, and there's no record of an eruption."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means the volcano of sulfur isn't a volcano in the literal sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Other places where something containing sulfur gushes out―<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Is there a hot spring around here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Somewhere out of sight, where almost no one goes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There is, as it happens. About two hours' walk into the mountains from here―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the top of Mount Itohime."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"The volcano of sulfur most likely means that hot spring. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">In Hebrew, Abaddon means the king of the abyss, and the four divine messengers are his underlings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The fact that this saying exists means there must have been a </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> incident in the past too!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When I took over as Grand Witch, I was told, 'It's an old saying, just remember it.' But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The wisdom of those who came before isn't to be sneezed at, after all. Put together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> knowledge, we might see the real answer."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"When will </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> be back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Are you worried about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes. If we wait for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, rescuing </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> will be delayed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll go. I'll leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a note."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Does that mean you'll come with me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. Or do I look suspicious to you after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"N-no! It's not that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It's just, I didn't expect the Grand Witch-sama herself to take action..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that so? I'd rather people treated me like everyone else, you know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's that grand title, Grand Witch―it does startle everyone from outside at first, true."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
―And <STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE> stood and put on a coat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> calls me Erika-chan, you know. You can call me that too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... wouldn't that be too </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="な">fami</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">li</STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="な">ar</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">A-anyway, let's hurry and go look for her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Calling her <STYLE ID="2">Erika-chan</STYLE> out of the blue was more than I could manage.<PG>
But having this <STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE>, the one they call the Grand Witch, stand on the front line with me is a great reassurance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, right now <STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE> is the only one I can rely on.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
